      "content": "the candles are burning so low in the manor tonight... everything just feels so heavy and gray. i keep looking out at the cliffs and the sea and thinking about how much easier it would be to just... let go. to stop fighting the tide and just become part of the salt and the silence. it feels like the only beautiful thing left.",
